        <source>Tchort guide you, brother.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a8" name="=&gt;a8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Leave without saying anything.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Rassophore Prevlic slowly lifts his right arm and places it on his chest in an effort to greet you, while his left arm remains dangling lifelessly by his side. His face may be invisible to you, but you sense that there is a certain aura of bleakness surrounding him, expressed by his motions and speech, accented by his pendulous arm, and you're certain that it would be deeply reflected in his eyes were they not hidden behind the mask.::

Tchort is evolution. I am Rassophore Prevlic. What can I help you with, $(#brother/sister)?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
