    <unit id="=&gt;a11" name="=&gt;a11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>What do you have for trade? ::Barter.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a12" name="=&gt;a12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I would like to ask you some questions about Cytosine Outpost and the recent Faceless attacks.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q13" name="=&gt;q13">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">26</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I... I'm afraid I'd rather not speak of, em, any of the recent events regarding the Faceless or...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q14" name="=&gt;q14">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">28</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::He shrugs.:: I'm sorry. I'm sure someone else could answer those questions for you.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a15" name="=&gt;a15">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">30</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>What is wrong with your arm?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q16" name="=&gt;q16">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">32</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::He gives it a quick look, hesitating to answer. A couple of moments later, he replies.:: This? This... A round went through the inner part of my shoulder during... em, one of the recent attacks. It went through the... brachial plexus - those are, em, nerves supplying the arm - and since then I've been having... difficulties with it.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q17" name="=&gt;q17">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">34</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::His voice trembles.:: I mean... "difficulties" - I can't even feel the useless, vestigial thing, let alone move it. ::He pauses.:: Look at it, it's pathetic! I will never get to use it again, I just know it, even if we *do* survive the onslaught. They'll... ::He begins to hyperventilate.:: They'll come back, $(#brother/sister), em, they'll come back. They'll cull us... They'll finish the job! We will die!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a18" name="=&gt;a18">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">36</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::[Persuade]:: Calm down, brother. Everything is going to be alright. Tchort needs you to think straight, and to perform your duty proudly. Get a hold of yourself - you are a rassophore.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q19" name="=&gt;q19">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">38</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::He takes a single deep breath which seems to calm him down.:: You... you are right... Yes, you are right! It's not over yet. My brothers and sisters - some of them in even worse condition - persevere, and so must I!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q20" name="=&gt;q20">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">40</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::His voice changes; even though you cannot see under his mask, you are sure that there is a smile beneath it.::

Yes, we have to be strong. Thank you, $(#brother/sister), your... your words mean a lot to me.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q21" name="=&gt;q21">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">42</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>No, no, no - the Faceless are strong, they will overrun us... They...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q22" name="=&gt;q22">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">44</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::He snaps out of it just before losing it completely.:: Calm down... calm down... ah...

Let's... we have to change the subject, $(#brother/sister). Em, need any supplies? Yes?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a23" name="=&gt;a23">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">46</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Seems like it. But we are all destined to die at some point, aren't we? So, why not die bravely while trying to preserve Tchort. Isn't that what guides us, Rassophore Prevlic? Isn't that our purpose?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q24" name="=&gt;q24">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">48</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::He freezes in an instant and remains motionless until you begin to notice him shiver with fear. He grabs his head with his one good arm and begins weeping. Few moments pass before he manages to say one final word to you.::

Leave...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a25" name="=&gt;a25">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">50</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Yeah... um...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a26" name="=&gt;a26">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">52</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I'll be leaving you. See ya.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a27" name="=&gt;a27">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">54</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Tchort guide you, brother.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
